  "description": "Nord Lead 2 virtual analog synthesizer: every control of its manual's MIDI controller list.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Nord Lead 2 User Manual, OS v1.0",
      "notes": "MIDI controller list (pages 91, 92 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/nord/read-nord-cc.mjs from Nord Lead 2 English User Manual v1.0.pdf (sha256 9c68029e78edb63fa4052f49e184ffbdb6c09a3a06ce195b3baa4cbaac1749a9), https://www.nordkeyboards.com/wt/documents/217/Nord%20Lead%202%20English%20User%20Manual%20v1.0.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/nord/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/nord/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller list, with its printed name, sent as the control change it prints on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "The manual: an on/off button is 0 off and 127 on; a button that steps through settings starts at 0 and goes up by 1 for each.",
    "The manual: a controller sent to a Percussion Kit changes the drum sound last selected for editing."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1
  },
